Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 44 (including cases applied mutatis mutandis pursuant to Article 52-2(9)), the previous provisions shall apply to facilities or other structures to be retained according to any of the following plans:
1. Implementation plans publicly notified pursuant to Article 29 before this Act enters into force;
